[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Cup of Coffee]
[00:00.80]Lesson 47 | 第47课
[00:02.57]A cup of coffee | 一杯咖啡
[00:05.29]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.58]How does Ann like her coffee? | 安喜欢她的咖啡里放什么？
[00:16.00]Do you like coffee, Ann? | 安，你喜欢喝咖啡吗？
[00:20.10]Yes, I do. | 是的，我喜欢。
[00:23.22]Do you want a cup? | 你想来一杯吗？
[00:25.94]Yes, please, Christine. | 好的，谢谢，克里斯廷。
[00:29.74]Do you want any sugar? | 你想放糖吗？
[00:32.98]Yes, please. | 好的，谢谢。
[00:35.56]Do you want any milk? | 你想放牛奶吗？
[00:38.82]No, thank you. | 不，谢谢。
[00:40.74]I don't like milk in my coffee. | 我不喜欢咖啡里放牛奶。
[00:44.37]I like black coffee. | 我喜欢黑咖啡。
[00:47.87]Do you like biscuits? | 你喜欢饼干吗？
[00:50.78]Yes, I do. | 是的，我喜欢。
[00:53.08]Do you want one? | 你想来一块吗？
[00:55.56]Yes, please. | 好的，谢谢。